test-suite.sh
platform-test.sh
update-test.sh

# Documentation files (choose which ones to keep)
PWA-TEST.md
TEST-RESULTS.md
VERIFICATION-REPORT.md
UPDATE-SYSTEM.md

# ========================
# 🔧 Development Tools
